/**
 * How Paulownia, five-three-five (`gosan-no-kiri`) is constructed, in a line in each language: the text a crest's card shows beside its steps.
 * It is here, not on the crest's record, so that the manifest stays small; `crestConstruction()` loads it.
 *
 * @example
 * ```ts no-run
 * import { description } from "@johnmorrisdotca/kamon-crests/steps/gosan-no-kiri";
 *
 * console.log(description.en.length > 30, description.ja.endsWith("。")); // true true
 * ```
 */
const description: { en: string; ja: string } = {"en":"Three broad leaves below, the middle one hanging and the two beside it spread; above them three upright spikes, five florets on the middle one and three on each of the others. A leaf is a rounded heart: its two upper edges are one compass width mirrored, and round its body are five scallops of one width. A white midrib runs from the leaf's base to its tip. On each side of it three white veins leave the base and sweep out and down toward the tip, one inside the other, following the leaf's outline; each is the white between two circles two apart, and each stops on a circle about the base, short of the edge. The middle leaf's base is the small circle where the leaves meet, and a side leaf's base lies just beside it. A spike is a thin upright stalk that rises from behind the leaves, with one floret on its top and pairs of florets below it on short side stems, each clear of its neighbours and of the stalk. A floret is a bud of three discs: a round head and two round shoulders. A side stem is the band between two circles two apart: it leaves the stalk outwards and turns up into the bud. The side leaves are the same plan at four fifths, turned out and passing under the middle leaf. The left half is struck first and the right half is struck in place as its mirror.","ja":"下に広い葉を三枚、中央の葉は垂らし、左右の葉は広げます。その上に花穂を三本立て、中央に五つ、左右に三つずつ花をつけます。葉は丸みのあるハート形です。上の左右の縁は同じ幅の円で、まわりに同じ幅の丸い裂片を五つ並べます。葉の付け根から葉先へ、白い葉脈を一本まっすぐ通します。その左右に三本ずつ、白い葉脈を付け根から出し、外へふくらませてから葉先のほうへ下ろします。三本は内側から外側へ順に並び、葉の輪郭に沿います。白い葉脈はどれも、幅が2だけ違う二つの円の間のすき間で、付け根を中心にした円のところ、縁の手前で止めます。中央の葉の付け根は、三枚の葉が集まる小さな円です。左右の葉の付け根は、そのすぐ横にあります。花穂は、葉の後ろから立ち上がる細い茎です。茎の上に花を一つ、その下に左右一対ずつの花を、短い枝の先につけます。花と花の間、花と茎の間には、白いすき間をあけます。花は三つの円でできたつぼみの形で、丸い頭が一つ、丸い肩が二つです。枝は、幅が2だけ違う二つの円の間の帯で、茎から外へ出て、上へ曲がって花に入ります。左右の葉は同じ形を五分の四の大きさにして外へ回し、中央の葉の下に入れます。左半分を先に作図し、右半分は左右反転させて、その場で作図します。"};

export default construction;
export { construction, description };
